    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1.4ex 1.4ex\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>max</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>otherwise</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>On simplifying&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"center left\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>max</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>otherwise</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mi>sinh</mi><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;is continuous at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>*</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi></math> is not continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;is continuous but not diff. at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"right\"><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>discontinuous</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>at</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>not</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>diff</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>at</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
